    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "NUM 3:2 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "These are the names of the sons of Aaron: Nadab the firstborn, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 3:4 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Nadab and Abihu died before the LORD when they offered strange fire before the LORD in the wilderness of Sinai, and they had no children. Eleazar and Ithamar ministered in the priest’s office in the presence of Aaron their father."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 3:32 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Eleazar the son of Aaron the priest shall be prince of the princes of the Levites, with the oversight of those who keep the requirements of the sanctuary."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 4:16 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“The duty of Eleazar the son of Aaron the priest shall be the oil for the light, the sweet incense, the continual meal offering, and the anointing oil, the requirements of all the tabernacle, and of all that is in it, the sanctuary, and its furnishings.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:37 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“Speak to Eleazar the son of Aaron the priest, that he take up the censers out of the burning, and scatter the fire away from the camp; for they are holy,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:39 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Eleazar the priest took the bronze censers which those who were burned had offered; and they beat them out for a covering of the altar,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 19:3 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "You shall give her to Eleazar the priest, and he shall bring her outside of the camp, and one shall kill her before his face."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 19:4 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Eleazar the priest shall take some of her blood with his finger, and sprinkle her blood toward the front of the Tent of Meeting seven times."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 20:25 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Take Aaron and Eleazar his son, and bring them up to Mount Hor;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 20:26 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "and strip Aaron of his garments, and put them on Eleazar his son. Aaron shall be gathered, and shall die there.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 20:28 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses stripped Aaron of his garments, and put them on Eleazar his son. Aaron died there on the top of the mountain, and Moses and Eleazar came down from the mountain."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 25:7 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "When Phinehas, the son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, saw it, he rose up from the middle of the congregation, and took a spear in his hand."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 25:11 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“Phinehas, the son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, has turned my wrath away from the children of Israel, in that he was jealous with my jealousy among them, so that I didn’t consume the children of Israel in my jealousy."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:1 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "After the plague, the LORD spoke to Moses and to Eleazar the son of Aaron the priest, saying,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:3 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses and Eleazar the priest spoke with them in the plains of Moab by the Jordan at Jericho, saying,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:60 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "To Aaron were born Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:63 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "These are those who were counted by Moses and Eleazar the priest, who counted the children of Israel in the plains of Moab by the Jordan at Jericho."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:2 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "They stood before Moses, before Eleazar the priest, and before the princes and all the congregation, at the door of the Tent of Meeting, saying,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:19 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Set him before Eleazar the priest, and before all the congregation; and commission him in their sight."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:21 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "He shall stand before Eleazar the priest, who shall inquire for him by the judgment of the Urim before the LORD. At his word they shall go out, and at his word they shall come in, both he and all the children of Israel with him, even all the congregation.”"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 27:22 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses did as the LORD commanded him. He took Joshua, and set him before Eleazar the priest and before all the congregation."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:6 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses sent them, one thousand of every tribe, to the war with Phinehas the son of Eleazar the priest, to the war, with the vessels of the sanctuary and the trumpets for the alarm in his hand."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:12 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "They brought the captives with the prey and the plunder, to Moses, and to Eleazar the priest, and to the congregation of the children of Israel, to the camp at the plains of Moab, which are by the Jordan at Jericho."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:13 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses and Eleazar the priest, with all the princes of the congregation, went out to meet them outside of the camp."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:21 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Eleazar the priest said to the men of war who went to the battle, “This is the statute of the law which the LORD has commanded Moses."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:26 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“Count the plunder that was taken, both of man and of animal, you, and Eleazar the priest, and the heads of the fathers’ households of the congregation;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:29 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Take it from their half, and give it to Eleazar the priest, for the LORD’s wave offering."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:31 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses and Eleazar the priest did as the LORD commanded Moses."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:41 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses gave the tribute, which was the LORD’s wave offering, to Eleazar the priest, as the LORD commanded Moses."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:51 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses and Eleazar the priest took their gold, even all worked jewels."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 31:54 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses and Eleazar the priest took the gold of the captains of thousands and of hundreds, and brought it into the Tent of Meeting for a memorial for the children of Israel before the LORD."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:2 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then the children of Gad and the children of Reuben came and spoke to Moses, and to Eleazar the priest, and to the princes of the congregation, saying,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:28 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "So Moses commanded concerning them to Eleazar the priest, and to Joshua the son of Nun, and to the heads of the fathers’ households of the tribes of the children of Israel."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 34:17 (WEB)",
        "textualBasisJa": "“These are the names of the men who shall divide the land to you for inheritance: Eleazar the priest, and Joshua the son of Nun."
      }
    ],
